  NOT FIXED against the in-run control.
  Look at |det| before concluding nothing happened: a mode that
  reaches |det| = 1.0 exactly is representing permutations even
  if accuracy has not moved. That is a real mechanistic result
  and a different claim from 'it trains now'.
  Next candidates, in order of cost:
    1. curriculum on the demand mixture (low frac(D=max) first --
       the trainability table says that regime trains reliably)
    2. grow K by inserting a beta=0 factor into a trained K-1
       model -- our construction proof says that embedding is exact
    3. orthogonality regularisation on the transition matrices

